SUMMARY:Play in Clay: Fairy Houses - 2 Day Event! $65 for both days\, paid
  in advance
DESCRIPTION:Full Circle Studio - Creative Arts\n**🌟 Full Circle Studio 
 Presents: Play in Clay - Fairy Houses! 🌟**\nGet ready to unleash your c
 reativity in this **magical two-day clay adventure**!\n\n**🗓 Dates & De
 tails:**\n\n* **October 10**: Make Session\n* **October 31**: Glaze Sessio
 n\n* **Cost**: $65 For Both Days\nIncludes all materials (clay\, use of to
 ols\, glaze and kiln firing)!\n\n🎉 **Event Highlights:**\n✨ **October
  10 - MAKE!**\nShape\, sculpt\, and mold your fairy house with your own ha
 nds! Infuse it with personal charm\, whimsy\, and creativity as you bring 
 your unique vision to life.\n✨ **October 31 - GLAZE!**\nTransform your f
 airy house with dazzling colors and finishes. Add the final touch of magic
  and watch your creation come to life!\n\n**🎨 Perfect For:**\n\n* Begin
 ners curious about clay (16+)\n* Experienced creators looking to add a tou
 ch of magic to their skills\n\nNo experience? No problem! We’ll provide 
 everything you need\, including materials and kiln firing.\n\n💌 **Bring
 :** Just your passion and a playful spirit. We’ll handle the rest!\nDon
 ’t miss this enchanting opportunity to create something truly special. S
 paces are limited—reserve your spot today!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/full-circle-studio/events/316277084/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260826T025944Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260826T025944Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
